From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Correct MT6357 ADC readings

Use the voltage channel mappings and resolution from Rabbit's published
MT6357 driver. Expose VBIF and bracket shared mux changes with restoration.
Include ADC resolution in the common IIO scale, propagate cleanup failures,
and serialize timeout recovery with conversions.

